  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The Malaugrym are a race of evil shapeshifters originating from the Plane of Shadow. Physically and mentally superior to most races, with a keen intelligence and undeniable charisma. They are masters of shapeshifting, far beyond the abilities of dopplegangers and the like.",
      "8": "Un humano larguilucho de piel pálida y ojos blancos carentes de pupilas, aunque rara vez muestra esta su verdadera forma. Los doppelgángers mayores son criaturas viles y egocéntricas, sumidos en intrincados complots y suplantando la identidad de otros."
    }
  },
